          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Standalone mode</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>حالت مستقل</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Lavoro in modalità autonoma</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Praca w trybie autonomicznym</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Работа в автономном режиме</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Bağımsız mod</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Standalone mode</value>
          </title>
          <toolTip>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>The application can work offline. If you are connected to the main server, the application will copy the necessary data to the local infobase, and after losing the connection, it will switch to standalone mode and continue working with the data.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>برنامه می‌تواند به‌صورت آفلاین کار کند. اگر به سرور اصلی متصل باشید، برنامه داده‌های لازم را در پایگاه اطلاعات محلی کپی می‌کند و پس از قطع اتصال، به حالت مستقل رفته و کار با داده‌ها را ادامه می‌دهد.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Приложение имеет возможность работать в автономном режиме. При наличии подключения к основному серверу приложение будет копировать необходимые данные в локальную базу, а после потери соединения переключится в автономный режим и продолжит работу с ними.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Uygulama tek başına modda çalışabilme özelliğine sahiptir. Ana sunucuya bağlantı olduğunda gerekli verileri yerel veritabanına kopyalar, bağlantı kesildiğinde ise tek başına moda geçer ve onlarla çalışmaya devam eder.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>The application can work offline. If you are connected to the main server, the application will copy the necessary data to the local infobase, and after losing the connection, it will switch to standalone mode and continue working with the data.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>The application can work offline. If you are connected to the main server, the application will copy the necessary data to the local infobase, and after losing the connection, it will switch to standalone mode and continue working with the data.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>The application can work offline. If you are connected to the main server, the application will copy the necessary data to the local infobase, and after losing the connection, it will switch to standalone mode and continue working with the data.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTipRepresentation>None</toolTipRepresentation>
          <horizontalStretch>true</horizontalStretch>
